{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02494","headline":"冬日宴于庶子宅各赋一字得色 · 封行高","name":"冬日宴于庶子宅各赋一字得色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夫君敬爱重，欢言情不极。\n雅引发清音，丽藻穷雕饰。\n水结曲池冰，日暖平亭色。\n引满既杯倾，终之以弁侧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"封行高","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}